- Tests: `./test/_all_.sh` passed (full interpreted + AOT matrix).
- Canary command baseline: `HVM_AOT_DEOPT=1 HVM_AOT_ALLOC=1 HVM_AOT_HEAP_ATTR=1 --as-c -s -T1`

